        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>KABA 7100 Series Simplex Keypad Deadbolt</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe KABA Simplex 7100 heavy duty mechanical pushbutton keypad deadbolt lock set. Deadbolt Latch - Unlock door with the pushbutton keypad from the outside.   Ideal for locations with frequent personal turnover - no keys required.  Easy to install, program and maintain.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nUse on doors such as conference rooms, offices, house/building entry doors, utility room doors and work shops.  Unlock door for exterior with single access combination code while allowing free egress at all times by interior thumbturn. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOther Simplex 7100 Series Models: \r\n<a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-gate-lock-kaba-7104\">KABA 7104 Simplex Keypad Gate Lock</a> <br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-RA109-specifications.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"580\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"KABA Simplex 7102 dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the KABA Simplex 7100 Series Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to maintain - no batteries to replace.</li>\r\n<li>Durable heavy-duty construction.</li>\r\n<li>Manual Relock</li>\r\n<li>Single access code—one easy to manage code for all users</li>\r\n<li>Easily programmed via keypad without removing lock from the door</li>\r\n<li>Highly weather resistant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of KABA Simplex 7100 Series Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Construction: </b> All metal cast  front housing. Force-proof clutch protected exterior thumbturn.</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Thickness: </b> 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Minimum Stile: </b> 4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Installation: </b> Easily installs on wood or metal doors. 1-3/8\" diameter through bore for housing; 3/4\" diameter for combination change. 1\" diameter cross bore for latch. </li>\r\n<li><b>Backset: </b> Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Latch: </b> 1\" deadbolt with flat front faceplate. </li>\r\n<li><b>Strike: </b> Flat deadbolt strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Handing: </b> Non-handed, field reversible. </li>\r\n<li><b>Numeric Keypad: </b> Vandal resistant, mechanical 5 button keypad.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Warranty: </b> One (1) Year.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-7100.pdf?v=1704262248\" target=\"new\"><b>KABA Simplex 7100 Series Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p><p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simplex Keypad Deadbolt Lock, KABA 710x",
